{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type DeepPartial<T> = T extends ReadonlyArray<infer U> ? DeepPartial<U>[] : T extends object ? { [K in keyof T]?: DeepPartial<T[K]> } : T;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L517","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:517"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Recursive "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Partial"},{"type":"text","value":" — every nested field becomes optional. Used as the\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"partial"},{"type":"text","value":" type on a streaming structured-output part since the progressive\nJSON parse hands back objects whose fields are only filled in as bytes\narrive. Defaulted in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DeepPartial<unknown>"},{"type":"text","value":" → "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":" so untyped parts\nkeep their existing shape."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype DeepPartial<T> = T extends ReadonlyArray<infer U> ? DeepPartial<U>[] : T extends object ? { [K in keyof T]?: DeepPartial<T[K]> } : T;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:517](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L517)\n\nRecursive `Partial` — every nested field becomes optional. Used as the\n`partial` type on a streaming structured-output part since the progressive\nJSON parse hands back objects whose fields are only filled in as bytes\narrive. Defaulted in `DeepPartial<unknown>` → `unknown` so untyped parts\nkeep their existing shape.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: DeepPartial\ntitle: DeepPartial\n---\n\n```ts\ntype DeepPartial<T> = T extends ReadonlyArray<infer U> ? DeepPartial<U>[] : T extends object ? { [K in keyof T]?: DeepPartial<T[K]> } : T;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:517](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L517)\n\nRecursive `Partial` — every nested field becomes optional. Used as the\n`partial` type on a streaming structured-output part since the progressive\nJSON parse hands back objects whose fields are only filled in as bytes\narrive. Defaulted in `DeepPartial<unknown>` → `unknown` so untyped parts\nkeep their existing shape.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n"}
